	(text "4. Add TestPoints!\nGreat for testing and serve as a backup if the board partially blows up.\nSearch the library for TestPoints.\nThese are real electric connections, \nwill look like a hole on the pcb connected to the corresponding rail.\nSome good testpoints to have will be for the 3.3V rail, 5V rail, battery power and GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
